        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-205, Melon Solid Brass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSophisticated in that it does not try to be overly fancy, the traditional styling of the Melon Cabinet Door Knob is a great addition to antique laden homes and contemporary apartments alike. There is something very homey about this cabinet knob. It may be the classic melon shape or it may be the array of 6 finishes in which this cabinet hardware is available; but what ever the case, the CK-205 made by RK International will be sure to add warmth and beauty to any space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/ridged-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-405\"><b>Matching CP-405 Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-205 Traditional Melon Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
